
DSGeorref uses a layered licensing policy.

Application code is licensed under AGPL-3.0-or-later. Reusable SDKs,
schemas and integration examples are licensed under Apache-2.0. Original
documentation is licensed under CC-BY-4.0. Datasets, fixtures, corpora,
models and other assets require an explicit license record before they can
be distributed.

The complete license texts are versioned in:

- LICENSES/AGPL-3.0-or-later.txt
- LICENSES/Apache-2.0.txt
- LICENSES/CC-BY-4.0.txt

File-class assignments are declared in .reuse/dep5. Third-party dependency
licenses and redistribution status are recorded in THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md
and in the versioned dependency inventory. See LICENSING.md for the
governing policy.
